        "description": "Pelle Pelle and Rolling Loud release an ultra-limited 100-piece collector’s jacket ahead of Rolling Loud Orlando 2026, merging festival energy with legacy craftsmanship.",
        "primaryKeyword": "Pelle Pelle Rolling Loud collector jacket",
        "canonical": "",
